# The game is published to GitHub Packages, not npmjs.com, and GitHub Packages
# has no anonymous npm read even for a public package. Installing therefore needs
# NODE_AUTH_TOKEN — a classic PAT with `read:packages`, exported locally and set
# as a repository secret in CI. See README § "The game dependency".
#
# Only the @andriy-fs scope is redirected; everything else still comes from
# npmjs.com, so a missing token breaks exactly one dependency and says so.
@andriy-fs:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
